{"name":"Pressure","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Impress or intimidate a foe. Choose an approach&mdash;your foe cannot choose to use that approach in the next exchange.</p>","approach":"advance-attack","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_u4n4w2vrt3b"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896810209,"modifiedTime":1668897384795,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"1CdMOj6xTFZa3bWg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3}}
{"name":"Doomed","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;re in grave danger&mdash;mark 1-fatigue every few seconds (or each exchange) until you free yourself.</p>","checked":false,"type":"negative"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.6p03eEr9gFmWqT5a"},"cf":{"id":"temp_6waose7i7yd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897742071,"modifiedTime":1668897835267,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"4MeGDYNsu0MABibN"}
{"name":"Trick","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>trick an NPC</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>. On a hit, they fall for it and do what you want for the moment. On a 7&ndash;9, pick one. On a 10+, pick two.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They stumble; take +1 forward to acting against them.</li>\n<li>They act foolishly; the GM tells you what additional opportunity they give you.</li>\n<li>They overcommit; they are deceived for some time.</li>\n</ul>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.Xzj2FtIie0ByAOlI"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896392221,"modifiedTime":1668897011785,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"4ozSlpzwC0C48iP3"}
{"name":"Strike","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Strike a foe in reach, forcing them to mark 2-fatigue, mark a condition, or shift their balance away from center, their choice. Mark 1-fatigue to instead choose to hammer them with your blows, forcing them to mark 2-fatigue, or strike where they are weak, inflicting a condition.</p>","approach":"advance-attack","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_u4n4w2vrt3b"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896792809,"modifiedTime":1668897380278,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"5flnRC9Y88ozxvfS","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3}}
{"name":"Smash","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Mark 1-fatigue to destroy or destabilize something in the environment&mdash;possibly inflicting or overcoming a fictionally appropriate positive or negative status.</p>","approach":"advance-attack","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_u4n4w2vrt3b"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896829025,"modifiedTime":1668897383611,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"6rdKoXKcH8ahCGFT","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3}}
