{"name":"Rely on Your Skills & Training","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>rely on your skills and training</strong> to overcome an obstacle, gain new insight, or perform a familiar custom, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span>. On a hit, you do it. On a 7&ndash;9, you do it imperfectly&mdash; the GM tells you how your approach might lead to unexpected consequences; accept those consequences or mark 1-fatigue.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"focus","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.GHrGlUuCV8vViQ8a"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896228391,"modifiedTime":1668897012584,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"9h9kvKB1bANaWLG3"}
{"name":"Test Balance","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Mark 1-fatigue to challenge an engaged foe&rsquo;s balance. Ask what their principle is; they must answer honestly. If you already know their principle, instead shift their balance away from center by questioning or challenging their beliefs or perspective.</p>","approach":"evade-observe","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_y1u0coddq0i"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896853210,"modifiedTime":1668897397429,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"AieNN4iU2A0YR6tc","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3}}
