{"name":"Guide and Comfort","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you try to honestly <strong>guide and comfort</strong> another person, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>. On a hit, they choose one:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They embrace your guidance and comfort. They may clear a condition or 2-fatigue, and you may ask one question; they must answer honestly.</li>\n<li>They shut you down. They inflict a condition on you, and you shift their balance in response.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a 10+, if they embrace your guidance and comfort, you may also shift their balance.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"harmony","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.iovxYoF09gJyZQd2"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896323881,"modifiedTime":1668897017125,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Huk8X5WKZBYdRLIa"}
{"name":"Angry","type":"condition","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>-2 to <strong>guide and comfort</strong> and <strong>assess a situation</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>To clear:</strong> break something important or lash out at a friend.</p>","checked":false},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.POrTyAyUfcQCbCwZ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_nmn4q1nx0yr"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897495826,"modifiedTime":1668897685902,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"IC7W4GUk2eOnsDL2"}
{"name":"Prepared","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;re ready for what&rsquo;s coming&mdash;clear <em>Prepared</em> to take +1 to an appropriate roll (after the roll) or avoid marking a condition.</p>","checked":false,"type":"positive"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.3NtxhcLXrhNdxjFF"},"cf":{"id":"temp_woc217r366i"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668898085939,"modifiedTime":1668898106431,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"IYe2X6tTsUufCuUk"}
{"name":"Stunned","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;re caught off-guard&mdash;you can&rsquo;t act or respond for a few seconds until you steady yourself.</p>","checked":false,"type":"negative"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.YwciyzJ5Yk1UgXQg"},"cf":{"id":"temp_6waose7i7yd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897802821,"modifiedTime":1668897832450,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"JWlfHr0bOX0dEVF1"}
