{"name":"Commit","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Recenter yourself amidst the fray. Shift your balance toward one of your principles; the next time you <strong>live up to that principle</strong>, do not mark fatigue.</p>","approach":"evade-observe","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_y1u0coddq0i"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896894233,"modifiedTime":1668897400952,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"OLLoolFy9KNQDZt0","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3}}
{"name":"Assess a Situation","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>assess a situation</strong>, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span>. On a 7&ndash;9, ask one question. On a 10+, ask two. Take +1 ongoing when acting on the answers.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What here can I use to ...?</li>\n<li>Who or what is the biggest threat?</li>\n<li>What should I be on the lookout for?</li>\n<li>What&rsquo;s my best way out/in/through?</li>\n<li>Who or what is in the greatest danger?</li>\n</ul>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"creativity","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.Y61qlrzpbZmZXsMQ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896121848,"modifiedTime":1668897018130,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"OUstky04TpCjlspq"}
{"name":"Afraid","type":"condition","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>-2 to <strong>intimidate</strong> and <strong>call someone out</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>To clear:</strong> run from danger or difficulty.</p>","checked":false},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.kLeJj5eCBJPldoEg"},"cf":{"id":"temp_nmn4q1nx0yr"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897456789,"modifiedTime":1668897686616,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"PBp5wH8gd0HWgg6S"}
