{"name":"Retaliate","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Steel yourself for their blows. Each time a foe inflicts fatigue, a condition, or shifts your balance in this exchange, inflict 1-fatigue on that foe.</p>","approach":"defend-maneuver","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.MGa1dG5PfWGYhW4U"},"cf":{"id":"temp_363u3kydac3"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896736824,"modifiedTime":1668897341374,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"V3JSPGKISofIHTGe"}
{"name":"Empowered","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>Your abilities are naturally stronger in this moment&mdash;clear 1-fatigue at the end of each exchange.</p>","checked":false,"type":"positive"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.XtKsQx2DY3jGoxRb"},"cf":{"id":"temp_woc217r366i"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668898016271,"modifiedTime":1668898110129,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"V9EadqfsyZqizdEV"}
{"name":"Help","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you take appropriate action to <strong>help a companion</strong>, mark 1-fatigue to give them a +1 to their roll (after the roll). You cannot help in a combat exchange in this way.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.dF2eHQzQn2F10HT4"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896194105,"modifiedTime":1668897016302,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"WPY7DVr55NaiTvYT"}
{"name":"#[CF_tempEntity]","type":"move","flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_5xu3p2va0lb","name":"Moves","color":"#111111","fontColor":"#FFFFFF","icon":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","sorting":"a","contents":[],"children":["temp_ys3wc4d1ofd","temp_jb53p9jele","temp_i47js3sps"],"folderPath":[],"version":"2.5.5"}},"img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897268808,"modifiedTime":1668899121609,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"WW9lcSglwStkkADE"}
{"name":"Intimidate","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>intimidate an NPC</strong> into backing off or giving in, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span>. On a hit, they choose one. On a 10+, first, you pick one they cannot choose.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They run to escape or get backup.</li>\n<li>They back down but keep watch.</li>\n<li>They give in with a few stipulations.</li>\n<li>They attack you, but off-balance; the GM marks a condition on them.</li>\n</ul>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"passion","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.JlbQ9zCT559yBAqA"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896273049,"modifiedTime":1668897015473,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"XphTYECNhp1Sz4m9"}
{"name":"Call Someone Out","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>openly call on someone to live up to their principle</strong>, shift your balance away from center, then name and roll with their principle. On a hit, they are called to act as you say; they must either do it or mark a condition. On a 7&ndash;9, they challenge your view of the world in turn; mark 1-fatigue or they shift your balance as they choose. On a miss, they can demand you act in accordance with one of your principles instead; mark a condition or act as they request.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"balance"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.utCu3G069zLwgBcB"},"cf":{"id":"temp_i47js3sps"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896487140,"modifiedTime":1668897041565,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Z4M6AWEvXg5HCXOF"}
{"name":"Live Up to your Principle","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>take action in accordance with the values of a principle</strong>, mark 1-fatigue to roll with that principle instead of whatever stat you would normally roll.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"balance"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.JOkcrO37mTwBwq26"},"cf":{"id":"temp_i47js3sps"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896463874,"modifiedTime":1668897040082,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"Zu9KlI5V6bQlXNXc"}
{"name":"Ready","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Mark 1-fatigue to ready yourself or your environment, assigning or clearing a fictionally appropriate status of nearby characters or yourself.</p>","approach":"defend-maneuver","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.xzYlsVjTUHsoDal2"},"cf":{"id":"temp_363u3kydac3"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896717349,"modifiedTime":1668897337509,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"cB14rjd05fhOmZvp"}
{"name":"Lose Your Balance","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>If your balance shifts past the end of the track, you <strong>lose your balance</strong>. You obsess over that principle to a degree that&rsquo;s not healthy for you or anyone around you. Choose one of the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Give in or submit to your opposition</li>\n<li>Lose control of yourself in a destructive and harmful way</li>\n<li>Take an extreme action in line with the principle, then flee</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Afterward, when you&rsquo;ve had some time to recover and recenter yourself, shift your center one step towards the principle you exceeded and clear all your conditions and fatigue. Reset your balance to your new center.</p>","rollable":false,"rollStat":"","category":"balance"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.sFiWfD66M7raRg3H"},"cf":{"id":"temp_i47js3sps"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896602591,"modifiedTime":1668897039313,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"cae40xdVKrJtMaMh"}
{"name":"Impaired","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;re slowed or off-balance&mdash;mark 1-fatigue or take a -2 to all physical actions (PCs) / choose one fewer technique (NPCs).</p>","checked":false,"type":"negative"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.8f65mk6Gu4KtUPcn"},"cf":{"id":"temp_6waose7i7yd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897759725,"modifiedTime":1668897833918,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"dmXT0gc9IGiQGLU9"}
