{"name":"Plead","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>plead with an NPC</strong> who cares what you think for help, support, or action, roll with <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>. On a 7&ndash;9, they need something more&mdash;evidence that this is the right course, guidance in making the right choices, or resources to aid them&mdash;before they act; the GM tells you what they need. On a 10+, they act now and do their best until the situation changes.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"harmony","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.xuUTMeguZTYl6it4"},"cf":{"id":"temp_ys3wc4d1ofd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896169060,"modifiedTime":1668897014594,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"mKzsnhcvq4e3Or89"}
{"name":"Insecure","type":"condition","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>-2 to <strong>trick</strong> and <strong>resist shifting your balance</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>To clear:</strong> take foolhardy action without talking to your companions.</p>","checked":false},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.aoHFl4vsnU09Vlb5"},"cf":{"id":"temp_nmn4q1nx0yr"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897598394,"modifiedTime":1668897684460,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"me913HCTuhzRPYaK"}
{"name":"Deny a Callout","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>deny an NPC calling on you to live up to your principle</strong>, roll with that principle. On a hit, act as they say or mark 1-fatigue. On a 10+, their words hit hard; you must also shift your balance towards the called-on principle. On a miss, you stand strong; clear a condition, clear 1-fatigue, or shift your balance, your choice.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"balance"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.ZcqwYagbcCvfvILH"},"cf":{"id":"temp_i47js3sps"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896519293,"modifiedTime":1668897040735,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"mzcw6nsnb327PxYb"}
