{"name":"3 - Guide a Companion?","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you guide a companion towards balance or end the session at your center?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.Qk9HUBW0MkZhfnyL"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pbugwla7yhf"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668898477878,"modifiedTime":1668898604329,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"s5EMntQgV0om3gqU"}
{"name":"Bolster or Hinder","type":"technique","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/technique.png","system":{"description":"<p>Aid or impede a nearby character, inflicting an appropriate status.</p>","approach":"evade-observe","basic":true,"learned":false,"practiced":false,"mastered":false,"training":"","specialty":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"cf":{"id":"temp_y1u0coddq0i"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896873898,"modifiedTime":1668897402700,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"_id":"tM8FKL5ymS8JxneG","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3}}
{"name":"Resist Shifting Your Balance","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you <strong>resist an NPC shifting your balance</strong>, roll. On a hit, you maintain your current balance in spite of their words or deeds. On a 10+, choose two. On a 7&ndash;9, choose one.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Clear a condition or mark growth by immediately acting to prove them wrong</li>\n<li>Shift your balance towards the opposite principle</li>\n<li>Learn what their principle is (if they have one); if you already know, take +1 forward against them</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, they know just what to say to throw you off balance. Mark a condition, and the GM shifts your balance twice.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"balance"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.aonpkw3iQuvOn5z4"},"cf":{"id":"temp_i47js3sps"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668896550574,"modifiedTime":1668897038411,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"tf5VQnIsNFxPNIdV"}
{"name":"Favored","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;re buoyed by circumstance&mdash;choose an additional basic or mastered technique in the next exchange, even on a miss.</p>","checked":false,"type":"positive"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.4kTfXJ0p9xFR7TBW"},"cf":{"id":"temp_woc217r366i"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668898040927,"modifiedTime":1668898108997,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"tkQWo2dvkSCvx4KB"}
{"name":"Training Move","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you spend time with a teacher learning and training in a new technique, roll with modifiers from the following questions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Is your balance in line with your center or are you free of conditions? If yes, take +1.</li>\n<li>Do you and your teacher share at least one background? If yes, take +1.</li>\n<li>Does your teacher agree with your reasons for training and learning? If no, take -1.</li>\n<li>Is the technique easy to grasp based on your current training, experience, and skills? If no, take -1.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a hit, you learn the technique, and your master shifts your balance. On a 10+, you learn it with ease, and it takes as little time as possible. On a 7-9, it either takes more time than normal, or you must mark two conditions. On a miss, you can&rsquo;t learn the technique yet because you need another lesson before you can grasp its full use. Your master will tell you what additional task you must undertake to put yourself into the correct state of mind; do it, and you learn the technique.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.DL7VihLbUB6FQNvh"},"cf":{"id":"temp_jb53p9jele"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897200365,"modifiedTime":1668897247807,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"usOvpsPvTrJSOEyc"}
{"name":"Stance Move","type":"move","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/move.png","system":{"description":"<p>When you resolve your approach, roll with the appropriate stat:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Defend and maneuver</strong> rolls with <span class=\"skill-name\">Focus</span></li>\n<li><strong>Advance and attack</strong> rolls with <span class=\"skill-name\">Passion</span></li>\n<li><strong>Evade and observe</strong> rolls with <span class=\"skill-name\">Creativity</span> or <span class=\"skill-name\">Harmony</span>, the PC&rsquo;s choice</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a 7&ndash;9, use one basic or mastered technique. On a 10+, choose one from this list instead:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mark 1-fatigue to use a learned technique</li>\n<li>Use one practiced technique</li>\n<li>Use two different basic or mastered techniques</li>\n</ul>\n<p>On a miss, you stumble, but you can shift your balance away from center to use one basic technique.</p>","rollable":true,"rollStat":"","category":"basic"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.L5ZmlJbUhcu5vaDy"},"cf":{"id":"temp_jb53p9jele"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897093586,"modifiedTime":1668897185699,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"wk4xCys32jfCnJO8"}
{"name":"Guilty","type":"condition","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>-2 to <strong>push your luck</strong> and +2 to <strong>deny a callout</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>To clear:</strong> make a personal sacrifice to absolve your guilt.</p>","checked":false},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.bo1szfdMh88j3maZ"},"cf":{"id":"temp_nmn4q1nx0yr"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897549794,"modifiedTime":1668897685240,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"xEuxcgaQlDN79NcA"}
{"name":"Troubled","type":"condition","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>-2 to <strong>plead</strong> and <strong>rely on your skills or training</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>To clear:</strong> seek guidance from a mentor or powerful figure.</p>","checked":false},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.zTT8BCCuwRyzgHuo"},"cf":{"id":"temp_nmn4q1nx0yr"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897646891,"modifiedTime":1668897683524,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"xFTuciNqeVx5k6Jz"}
{"name":"1- Learn Something?","type":"growth-question","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/growth-question.png","system":{"description":"Did you learn something challenging, exciting, or complicated about the world?"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.oukPVceNQSfYdE0B"},"cf":{"id":"temp_pbugwla7yhf"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668898438365,"modifiedTime":1668898606608,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"y2ZTkogu2mC01IfB"}
{"name":"Trapped","type":"status","img":"systems/legends/images/tokens/condition.png","system":{"description":"<p>You&rsquo;re completely helpless&mdash;you must mark a combination of three conditions or fatigue to escape.</p>","checked":false,"type":"negative"},"effects":[],"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Item.sHYIGr20SwAaUQ3k"},"cf":{"id":"temp_6waose7i7yd"}},"_stats":{"systemId":"legends","systemVersion":"0.3.15","coreVersion":"10.290","createdTime":1668897777063,"modifiedTime":1668897830263,"lastModifiedBy":"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww"},"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"J2YTNkdactPZw8ww":3},"_id":"zMmMvZby3D6dJmsM"}
